  "bodyHash": "B70XJmDjgFg=",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/18/ima1244564353ge.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢迎来到 RealmRPG，一个包含原版风格中世纪奇幻内容的模组系列！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>海底居民</strong>模组增添了奇特的鱼人商人和水下村庄，同时保持与原版游戏风格和平衡性的高度一致。&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/857/newcanvas332342321312-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"423\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>特色内容</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12种海洋商人</strong>，提供独特商品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>60余座建筑</strong>，让空旷的海洋变得丰富多彩。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>30多种新物品</strong>，增强你的水下探索体验。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>约10个任务</strong>来自<strong>海洋巨龙</strong>，需要细致探索才能完成。</span></li>\n<li>全新的水下文化——<strong>贻贝群落</strong></li>\n<li>5种新型食物</li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1271/7/ocean_dragon3-gif.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/957/11111111111-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>警告</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">所有3.0.0以上版本（Minecraft 1.18及以上）需要安装 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">着色器下动画失效？请在着色器设置中禁用实体阴影。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/956/111111111112-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置与建议<br></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组默认可与任何其他模组良好兼容。虽然没有传统配置文件，但你仍可通过自行创建带标签的数据包来自定义多项功能。&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>野生鱼人的生成通过placed_feature配置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别兼容：农夫乐事、水产养殖、我们已逝的生物群系、未探索区域、Terralith。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组旧版信息请见<a href=\"https://github.com/BlackAures1/SeaDwellersWiki/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/955/11111111111222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>权限与常见问题</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许在视频和整合包中使用本模组，需标注来源并指向本站下载链接。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止在个人项目中使用本模组内容（纹理、模型等）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止将本模组重新上传至其他网站和启动器。&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">暂无开发Fabric版本或回溯移植新功能的计划！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎提交漏洞报告和平衡性调整建议。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1270/958/111111111112222-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"756\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致谢<br></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组作者 -<strong> NoCube, Black Aures</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发工具 -<strong> MCreator, Blockbench, PaintNet</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵感来源<strong> - 《卢卡》、《黑湖妖谭》、克苏鲁神话生物。</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;更多Realm RPG模组：<br></span><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nocubes-sea-dwellers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/891/22/638332229090166009.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-creep-crop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/895/730/638340578799643798.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-imps-demons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/886/558/638323109380204126.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-dragon-wyrms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/792/638291974755181770.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realm-rpg-fallen-adventurers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/882/139/638313378229849817.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pots-and-mimics-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/493/638246901123812282.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></strong></span><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gothic-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/851/851/638254279369665236.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></strong></a></span></p>",
